---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About — Tualatin Oregon Growth Network"
  description="TOGN was founded in 2026 by Tualatin residents Brandon Philips and Nisha George."
>
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>About Tualatin Oregon Growth Network</h1>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">

      <div class="vision">
        <p>
          Tualatin Oregon Growth Network (TOGN) was founded in 2026 by Tualatin residents Brandon Philips and Nisha George.
          We envision a Tualatin that thrives and grows with a focus on strong fiscal responsibility,
          excellent design/engineering, sustainability, and preparedness for the future.
        </p>
        <p>We would love to meet you and grow Tualatin together!</p>
      </div>

      <div class="founders-photo">
        <img src="/brandon-nisha.jpg" alt="Brandon Philips and Nisha George, TOGN co-founders" />
      </div>

      <div class="founders">
        <div class="founder">
          <h2>Brandon Philips</h2>
          <p>
            Brandon has experience in community organization and government reforms, including
            the Washington County <a href="https://cedarmillnews.com/article/1122-neighborhoodstreets/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Neighborhood Streets Program</a>
            and advocacy around <a href="https://nabgas.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">gas stations in the county</a>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="founder">
          <h2>Nisha George</h2>
          <p>
            Nisha is a member of the <a href="https://cleanwaterservices.org/about/leadership-departments/cwac/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Clean Water Services Advisory Committee</a>
            and the Tualatin Parks Advisory Committee. She previously worked for the Army Corps
            of Engineers on hydropower dams.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="orgs-section">
        <h2>Organizations We Like</h2>
        <div class="orgs">
          <a class="org-card" href="https://www.climatetownproductions.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <div class="org-name">Climate Town</div>
            <p>Engaging media and community action on the climate crisis.</p>
          </a>
          <a class="org-card" href="https://electrifypdx.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <div class="org-name">Electrify Portland</div>
            <p>Helping Portland-area homes and businesses go all-electric.</p>
          </a>
          <a class="org-card" href="https://www.rewiringamerica.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <div class="org-name">Rewiring America</div>
            <p>Electrifying everything — a roadmap for a clean energy future.</p>
          </a>
          <a class="org-card" href="https://backyardhabitats.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <div class="org-name">Backyard Habitats</div>
            <p>Certifying yards as wildlife habitat using native plants in the Portland metro area.</p>
          </a>
          <a class="org-card" href="https://tualatinriverkeepers.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <div class="org-name">Tualatin Riverkeepers</div>
            <p>Restores and protects the incredible Tualatin River Watershed.</p>
          </a>
          <a class="org-card" href="https://www.strongtowns.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <div class="org-name">Strong Towns</div>
            <p>A movement to help towns and cities become financially strong and resilient.</p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-header {
    background: var(--green-dark);
    color: var(--white);
    padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
  }

  .page-header h1 { font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 800; }

  .container { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; }

  .section { padding: 3rem 1.5rem 5rem; }

  .vision {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .vision p + p { margin-top: 0.75rem; }

  .founders-photo {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
  }

  .founders-photo img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .founders {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .founder {
    background: var(--white);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 1.75rem 1.5rem;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.07);
    border-top: 4px solid var(--green-light);
  }

  .founder h2 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--green-dark);
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .founder p { font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text-light); line-height: 1.65; }

  .founder a { color: var(--green-mid); }
  .founder a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

  /* Orgs */
  .orgs-section { margin-top: 3rem; }

  .orgs-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--green-dark);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .orgs {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .org-card {
    display: block;
    background: var(--white);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.25rem;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.07);
    border-bottom: 3px solid var(--green-light);
    transition: box-shadow 0.2s, transform 0.15s;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
  }

  .org-card:hover {
    box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .org-name {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--green-dark);
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .org-card p {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-light);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
</style>
